WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.673
ChatGPT ko 20 dollar dene se pehle, ye dekh lo ki local AI 7 din me kahan fail hua.

2
00:00:03.773 --> 00:00:06.985
Har jagah log bol rahe hain ki local AI aate hi cloud subscriptions band ho jayengi.

3
00:00:07.085 --> 00:00:09.570
Zero API cost, poori data privacy, aur zero internet requirement.

4
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:13.149
Maine DeepSeek R1 ko poore 7 din apne local machine par real coding tasks ke liye use kiya.

5
00:00:13.249 --> 00:00:17.264
Aaj main aapko practical benchmark dikhaunga ki ye kahan best hai aur kahan aapka laptop crash ho jayega.

6
00:00:17.364 --> 00:00:18.564
Pehle hardware ka sach jaan lo.

7
00:00:18.664 --> 00:00:22.717
Aapko 5 lakh ka Nvidia GPU nahi chahiye, lekin 8GB RAM wale laptop par reasoning models chalana bhool jao.

8
00:00:22.817 --> 00:00:26.028
7B model 35 tokens per second deta hai, lekin complex bugs me hallucinate karta hai.

9
00:00:26.128 --> 00:00:30.219
14B model sabse solid sweet spot hai: 22 tokens per second deta hai aur 12GB RAM ke andar fit ho jaata hai.

10
00:00:30.319 --> 00:00:35.366
Agar aap bina 32GB RAM ke 32B model run karoge, toh machine swap memory me phas jayegi aur speed 2 tokens per second par gir jayegi.

11
00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:37.110
Itna slow ki haath se code likhna tez hoga.

12
00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:38.548
Ab actual code quality dekhte hain.

13
00:00:38.648 --> 00:00:42.357
Humne isko ek real production bug diya: circular import par crash hone wala recursive AST parser.

14
00:00:42.457 --> 00:00:44.330
Terminal me iska `<think>` reasoning block dekho.

15
00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.954
Isne code likhne se pehle 18 seconds tak call stack evaluate kiya.

16
00:00:47.054 --> 00:00:49.615
Aur visited set use karke cycle detection perfectly implement kiya.

17
00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:53.462
Single-file coding aur debugging me isne GPT-4o ko match kar diya, wo bhi bina kisi cloud call ke.

18
00:00:53.562 --> 00:00:55.244
Ab aate hain us sach par jo koi nahi batata.

19
00:00:55.344 --> 00:00:56.544
Pehla issue hai context window.

20
00:00:56.644 --> 00:01:00.162
Jaise hi aapka codebase 8,000 tokens se bada hota hai, model purani files bhoolne lagta hai.

21
00:01:00.262 --> 00:01:01.677
Doosra issue hai battery aur heating.

22
00:01:01.777 --> 00:01:06.212
Battery par 14B model run karne se 2 ghante me laptop 100% se 20% par aa gaya aur fans full speed par chalu ho gaye.

23
00:01:06.312 --> 00:01:11.320
Agar desk par plugged-in ho toh ye tool game-saver hai, lekin badhe codebases ke liye cloud models ko fully replace nahi kar sakta.

24
00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.938
Agar aapko apne laptop par ye test karna hai, toh description me setup commands pinned hain.

25
00:01:15.038 --> 00:01:16.873
Bas teen commands me offline setup ho jaata hai.

26
00:01:16.973 --> 00:01:18.423
Isko apne machine par run karke dekho aur comment me batao ki aapko kitni token speed mili.
